// A K of reduced inputs not rotated beyond gainFloor of the gain of its X,
// within gainTol, takes the Hewer gain of that X; should Hewer fail, K is
// returned at Accuracy 1, as at the gainFloor gates. Unfixed, Hewer failed
// and K was accepted at Accuracy 0 off the 320-bit gain by 2.756e-3 (rv49v
